# Artifacts staged by `cargo xtask unity build` (regenerated, not committed).
# Source of truth is bindings/csharp/src (C#) and the committed package.json /
# *.asmdef / Samples~ in each package directory.

# staged C# sources (top level of each package only; Samples~ stays committed)
*/*.cs

# generated .meta (deterministic GUIDs from xtask; regenerated on build)
*/*.meta

# staged native cdylibs and their folder/plugin metas
*/Plugins/
